<title>USA: Kohl's Corp Oct same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Kohl's Corp Oct same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $178.3     $135.8     +31.2	+15.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,541.3   $1,218.7     +26.5	+11.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	4 weeks ended	   Nov 2.</p>
<p>NOTE: Due to shift in fiscal calendar, fiscal month ending dates are one week later this year than year ago. On calendar basis, matching periods ended November 2, 1996 with the periods ended November 4, 1995, total sales increased 14.3 pct for month and 22.9 pct year-to-date. Comparable store sales on this basis increased 4 pct for month and 8.6 pct year-to-date.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
